{
  "$comment": "Not served, and deliberately valueless. This file exists only so Bun's dev-server HTML bundler can resolve the <link rel=\"manifest\"> href in src/index.html; Bun.serve has no `external` option, unlike Bun.build. The manifest actually served comes from src/manifest.ts: the dev server generates it per request, and build.ts writes dist/manifest.webmanifest from it. Adding real values here does nothing except let them go stale - src/manifest.test.ts fails if you do."
}
